## Verification Plan

### Automated/Unit Tests
- Write robust tests utilizing the Standard C++ environment to prove the time complexity invariants (e.g., Cache eviction works in O(1), Trie correctly completes words).
- Benchmark the query latency comparing a "Brute Force" search vs. "Our Indexer" search. This benchmarking output is what will genuinely impress interviewers.

### Manual Verification
- We will boot up the engine and run live queries on the command line. We'll verify that partial queries output correct Trie suggestions and full queries return accurate, top-ranked documents fast.
- You can manually observe the cache hits vs. cache misses outputting to the console.
